{
    "title": "Beauty Solitaire - Card Games",
    "description": "<b>Solitaire card games lovers who enjoy classic card game can play the patience game for free, both offline and online!</b> If you love Classic Solitaire or Patience, you must love this beautiful and charming Classic Solitaire Card Game! Welcome to Beauty Solitaire - Card Games! Dive into a world where classic card games meet enchanting charm. Step into a world where strategy meets beauty\u2014unlock stunning scenes as you master solitaire with the most captivating girls. \r\n\r\nMAIN FEATURE OF CLASSIC SOLITAIRE CARD GAMES\r\n\u2022 Mysterious Characters: Unlock and collect charming beauty characters that make your solitaire game journey unique.\r\n\u2022 Beautiful Scenes: Explore romantic card games backgrounds and challenging levels, each with mysterious beauty character revelations.\r\n\u2022 Customization: Set character selfies as your game background, making them your delightful companions.\r\n\u2022 Smooth Gameplay: Enjoy easy tap or drag controls for a perfect solitaire experience, both offline and online.\r\n\r\nWHY CHOOSE BEAUTY SOLITAIRE CARD GAMES?\r\n- Classic Gameplay: Enjoy the timeless fun of solitaire card games, also known as Patience, with a modern twist.\r\n- Brain Training: Test your skills and patience, enhancing your brainpower with each card game.\r\n- Variety: From classic solitaire to FreeCell and Spider, explore different modes and keep the fun going.\r\n- Perfect for All: Whether you\u2019re a seasoned solitaire player or new to card games, Beauty Solitaire offers something for everyone.\r\n- Anytime, Anywhere: Play offline or online, making it perfect for those moments when you need a quick break or a relaxing session.\r\n- No Pressure: Unlimited free hints and undos ensure a stress-free gaming experience.\r\n- Challenging Levels: Each level is designed to test your strategy and skills, keeping you engaged and entertained.\r\n- Exciting Rewards: Unlock new characters and backgrounds as you progress, adding an extra layer of fun to your journey.\r\n\r\n<b>Solitaire, also known as Patience, is the most addictive card game, enjoyed by millions of classic card games players around the world.</b> Beauty Solitaire - Card Games is a puzzle game, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri Peaks, Pyramind, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon. Like Spider Solitaire, Freecell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, this card game is definitely more fun! The Original Solitaire Game brings a new experience to the Classic Solitaire Card Game!\r\n\r\nHOW TO  PLAY\r\n\u2660 To solve this Solitaire card puzzle, you should move all cards of 4 suits - hearts, diamonds, spades and crosses to the foundations. There is one deck - 52 cards in the classic Solitaire card game. \r\n\u2660 You need to stack cards by suit, from Aces to King (A, 2, 3 and more). You can also move cards between columns, and stack cards in descending order and differentiate between red and black suits. For example, a black 10 could only be followed by a red 9. Only a King could be placed in the Free Column. You can move the stack of cards by dragging the whole stack to another column. Play classic Solitaire games and you can choose any scoring mode you like. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea9Play the #1 FREE SOLITAIRE card game now! See for yourself why so many people love this solitaire game! Classic solitaire refreshes your day. Unlock exclusive scenes with breathtaking beauties at every win. Have fun with this classic solitaire card game in no minutes! Experience the perfect blend of fun, relaxation, and challenge with this enchanting card game. Don\u2019t miss out on the charm \u2013 play today and discover the joy of beauty solitaire card games with a twist! \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.wittgames.com/bp/Privacy-Policy.html",
