ra layer of fun to your journey.<br><br><b>Solitaire, also known as Patience, is the most addictive card game, enjoyed by millions of classic card games players around the world.</b> Beauty Solitaire - Card Games is a puzzle game, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri Peaks, Pyramind, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon. Like Spider Solitaire, Freecell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, this card game is definitely more fun! The Original Solitaire Game brings a new experience to the Classic Solitaire Card Game!<br><br>HOW TO  PLAY<br>\u2660 To solve this Solitaire card puzzle, you should move all cards of 4 suits - hearts, diamonds, spades and crosses to the foundations. There is one deck - 52 cards in the classic Solitaire card game. <br>\u2660 You need to stack cards by suit, from Aces to King (A, 2, 3 and more). You can also move cards between columns, and stack cards in descending order and differentiate between red and black suits. For example, a black 10 could only be followed by a red 9. Only a King could be placed in the Free Column. You can move the stack of cards by dragging the whole stack to another column. Play classic Solitaire games and you can choose any scoring mode you like. <br><br>\ud83d\udea9Play the #1 FREE SOLITAIRE card game now! See for yourself why so many people love this solitaire game! Classic solitaire refreshes your day. Unlock exclusive scenes with breathtaking beauties at every win. Have fun with this classic solitaire card game in no minutes! Experience the perfect blend of fun, relaxation, and challenge with this enchanting card game. Don\u2019t miss out on the charm \u2013 play today and discover the joy of beauty solitaire card games with a twist! <br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.wittgames.com/bp/Privacy-Policy.html",
